10752886,2024-11-12,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"To Whom It May Concern, I am submitting this formal complaint regarding XXXX XXXX mishandling of my account XXXX. The unauthorized deactivation of my automatic payment ( autopay ) feature, excessive unauthorized monthly deductions, and the inaccurate reporting of missed payments have caused significant financial and credit harm. These actions constitute clear violations of both federal and New York State consumer protection laws. 

