10854217,2024-11-19,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, Florida XXXX XX/XX/XXXX TransUnion LLC XXXX XXXX Department XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, PA XXXX Subject : Notice of Intent to Sue for Violation of the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) Dear TransUnion, I am writing to formally notify you of your violation of my rights under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( 15 U.S.C. 1681 et seq. ). Specifically, your failure to take appropriate action after receiving my identity theft affidavit constitutes noncompliance with your statutory obligations. 

