10908570,2024-11-24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX ( XXXX XXXX ), XXXX XXXX, XXXX, XXXX XXXX XXXX, Equifax, XXXX, and XXXX RE : Formal Cease-and-Desist Demand for Reporting Inaccurate Information Case No. XXXX Cease-and-Desist Demand under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) ( 15 U.S.C. 1681 et seq. ) and Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) ( 15 U.S.C. 1692 et seq. ) in relation to your repeated and willful reporting of inaccurate, unverifiable, and unauthorized information about me to the credit reporting agencies ( Equifax, XXXX, and XXXX ). Despite my numerous attempts to resolve these issues, including certified mail correspondence providing proof of inaccuracies, you continue to report false and misleading information, causing significant and ongoing harm to my credit, reputation, and financial future. 

