2. Remove all negative information from my credit reports, including but not limited to data reported by XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX ( XXXX XXXX ), XXXX XXXX, XXXX, and XXXX XXXX XXXX. 
XXXX. XXXX a full investigation into my disputes and provide written confirmation within 15 days of receipt of this letter that the disputed entries have been deleted or corrected. 

Consequences of Continued Noncompliance If you fail to comply with this demand, I will pursue additional legal remedies, including : 1. Escalating Damages : Under 15 U.S.C. 1681n, I will seek {$1000.00} per inaccurate entry as statutory damages, punitive damages for willful noncompliance, and recovery of financial losses exceeding {$100000.00}, as well as compensation for emotional distress and reputational harm. 
