3. Court-Imposed Sanctions and Additional Claims : Your ongoing noncompliance will be submitted as further evidence in XXXX XXXX. XXXX to request sanctions and expanded claims for damages caused by your willful disregard for the law. 

Final Warning This is your final notice. Your continued violations of federal law and refusal to take corrective action are not only unlawful but demonstrate reckless indifference to the harm you have caused to my credit, reputation, and familys future. Failure to comply will result in further legal and regulatory actions. 

